cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use spatialcyte in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "spatialcyte: multiplexed IHC images to spatial single-cell objects"
abstract: >-
  Turns a multiplexed immunohistochemistry image and a one-file panel
  configuration into a spatial single-cell AnnData object with per-marker
  whole-cell, nuclear, membrane, cytoplasm and extracellular-ring intensities,
  morphology, distances to segmented tissue regions and a spatial neighbour
  graph.
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Yuexin
    affiliation: Fred Hutchinson Cancer Center
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-23"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/YuexinXu/spatialcyte"
keywords:
  - multiplexed immunohistochemistry
  - spatial biology
  - single-cell
  - AnnData
  - tumor microenvironment
